This is a modified version of Toolbox that supports .jarc, .jmdl, and .jtex files. These filetypes mostly appear in games developed by Ganbarion. (Several One Piece games, Wii Fit U, etc.)
You will need to use the .jarc quickBMS script to extract assets from a .jarc file. In the case of Wii Fit U, they've been renamed to .carc, for whatever reason. For some archives, you will have to extract the .brres files within a .jarc file and use the BMS script on that.


This fork was originally created by a user who has since taken their accounts offline, with additional updates by showstopper3934.
jarc.bms from the now-archived aluigi.altervista.org/quickbms.
I did not write any of the code for this version of Toolbox and am only rehosting it.
